This product includes software developed by the ScaleHLS Authors.

The HLS dialect and its transformation passes -- everything under
include/sar/Dialect/HLS, lib/Dialect/HLS and lib/Target/HLS -- derive from
ScaleHLS-HIDA (https://github.com/UIUC-ChenLab/ScaleHLS-HIDA), licensed
under the Apache License 2.0 with LLVM exceptions. Those files carry the
original copyright notice.

The derived code has been substantially modified: the dialect and passes
were renamed into this project's namespace, the TOSA and PyTorch frontends,
design-space exploration and QoR estimation were removed, and the remaining
passes were reworked -- notably tiling, array partitioning, dataflow
legalization and AXI interface shaping.
